<title>FRANCE: Scor H1 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Scor H1 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Profit					 288    vs	  206</p>
<p>    Turnover				     6,500  up   10.6 pct</p>
<p>NOTE -The company released its results in a statement.</p>
